# Все Rust-шарды Parvane в одном образе (каждый сервис compose запускает свой бинарь).
# Контекст сборки — backend/ (Cargo workspace), ignorefile — shards.dockerignore.
# ВАЖНО: target-cpu=x86-64 (baseline) — прод-сервер m60-7 на Xeon 5160 без SSE4.2/AVX.

FROM rust:1-bookworm AS builder
WORKDIR /src
ENV RUSTFLAGS="-C target-cpu=x86-64"
COPY Cargo.toml Cargo.lock ./
COPY shared ./shared
COPY shards ./shards
RUN cargo build --release --locked \
    -p identity -p messenger -p cloud -p call -p preview -p push -p gateway

FROM debian:bookworm-slim
RUN apt-get update \
    && apt-get install -y --no-install-recommends ca-certificates \
    && rm -rf /var/lib/apt/lists/* \
    # P-31: шарды не под root; /data — каталог тома (ownership наследуется
    # именованным томом при первом создании)
    && groupadd -r -g 10001 parvane && useradd -r -u 10001 -g parvane -d /nonexistent -s /usr/sbin/nologin parvane \
    && mkdir -p /data && chown parvane:parvane /data
COPY --from=builder /src/target/release/identity /usr/local/bin/identity
COPY --from=builder /src/target/release/messenger /usr/local/bin/messenger
COPY --from=builder /src/target/release/cloud /usr/local/bin/cloud
COPY --from=builder /src/target/release/call /usr/local/bin/call
COPY --from=builder /src/target/release/preview /usr/local/bin/preview
COPY --from=builder /src/target/release/push /usr/local/bin/push
COPY --from=builder /src/target/release/gateway /usr/local/bin/gateway
USER parvane
